From 654a7427b9511b47ef036edbc2fe87438acba6ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:26:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/22] test-posix: Check the restartable conversions and their
 states

mbrtowc, mbrlen, wcrtomb, mbsinit, btowc and wctob, and mbsrtowcs,
mbsnrtowcs, wcsrtombs and wcsnrtombs: return values, null arguments,
the source pointer and limits, EILSEQ, errno on success, and that each
function has its own internal state. The UTF-8 checks run where
C.UTF-8 exists.
